        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel RT (Live Patch 3 for SLE 15 SP7)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 6.4.0-150700_7_13 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2025-38664: ice: Fix a null pointer dereference in ice_copy_and_init_pkg() (bsc#1248631).\n- CVE-2025-38618: vsock: Do not allow binding to VMADDR_PORT_ANY (bsc#1249207).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
